# Code owners for hotel-app.
#
# Single maintainer today, so this does not gate merges — the ruleset does not
# set `require_code_owner_review`, and enabling it would deadlock a solo repo
# (you cannot approve your own pull request). What it does do is auto-request
# review on the paths below, so a Dependabot bump or an outside contribution
# that touches money, auth, or the schema surfaces as a review request instead
# of arriving as one line in a 40-file diff.
#
# The paths are the ones CLAUDE.md marks as needing targeted tests or explicit
# approval: money, tax, auth, RBAC, passkey/2FA, eKYC, booking state, ledgers,
# night audit — plus the CI/deploy and schema machinery that can break every
# installed database at once.

